\newlabel{fig:eval-capacity}{{9}{14}{Safe AI capacity in the exact-checked capacity model (13,716 mandatory-feasible points). (a) AI capacity relative to the offline oracle as the number of cells grows. (b) AI capacity as the AI deadline tightens. (c) Radio violation probability of idle-time admission; static reservation, recovery-first, and \sys never violate the all-fail schedule. Idle-time admission is omitted from (a) and (b) because the AI that it admits exceeds the safe capacity}{figure.caption.15}{}}
